If concealability is an issue, I again recommend either a Glock 19,
the slightly shorter version of their 9mm, or some form of .380, such
as the Walther/Interarms, the KDI clones of the Walther, the SIG P230,
etc. The  .380 is not much of a cartridge, but with a good load and
